  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Willie Roy**: back after 46 archived shows (1008 days); rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **Nashville Pickin**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Shackles & Chains**: back after 42 archived shows (780 days); rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Big Mon**: back after 36 archived shows (658 days) [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2017-05-21.Zoom.Flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 93 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The set leaned toward traditional bluegrass and played to a small crowd, estimated at about fifty fans [1]\n- It took place the day after Billy Strings played Susquehanna Breakdown [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2017-05-21.Zoom.Flac24**: taped by Josh McIntosh; transferred by Jerry Forever; source: Zoom H1n Recorder (24 Bit/48) [1]. Also: Recorded on a Zoom H1n at 24-bit/48; SD card to Audacity for level adjustment, then CDWAV tracking, then FLAC [1]",
